wo genomic regions  that  are connected by intervening  genomic fragments  double hop fusions we  present here has  internal genomic region of modern  southern  base pairs and some fusion are even  spliced  in these regions this type  of fusion transcripts can't be found  without the long read  transcriptome sequencing  we confirmed the existence of double hop  fusion involving er elv fld1  by sangha sequencing of pcl  amplicons  because uh the full uh  coding sequence of eldfld1  is included in this uh fusion transcript  uh it is considered that the full length  uh elba fld1 protein  is translated was translated  in this sample  and the expression of elbaf rd1  was exclusively detected in the samples  in the sample carrying this fusion  transcript  the expression of uh it is reported  it was reported that erp expression of  elv fld1  is generally suppressed in  across all the tissues except for  placenta  considering the chromatin modification  status  of the genomic  locuses loci  it is highly possible that  the expression of this transcript is  regulated by  the cis regulatory element of  histone 1h  the chromatin modifications  associated with uh promoter y has a  function  was detected in histone one h  c regulatory region in  triple negative breast cancer cell lines  and in normal  anomaly epsilon and these data  suggest suggested the existence of  mechanisms like enhancer hijacking  because it is it was reported that  elv fld1 suppressed the anti-tumor  immune response in allergenic  mouse tumor model so  we measure the growth of tumors  expressing  elv1  in syngenic mass model in which mc38  colon mirroring tumor cells  derived from b6 mice was used  as shown in the left graph  mc38 cells expressing erb fld1  generated larger tumors  than control mc38  cells infected with  empty mock mtb vector  in contrast uh  mc38 cells expressing  elva fld1 and control  mc38 cells generated  [Music]  tumors with similar size so these data  indicated that elba fld1  promoted tumor growth by inhibiting  other human immune response of the host  b6 mice and that enhanced expression of  elv1 in human cancer cells might  contribute to the tumor growth  so in summary we developed  a pipeline for merged samples with  transcriptome assembly musta  to analyze isosic data  musta enabled control  construction of transcriptome from 22  breast cancer clinical specimens  and we identified sometimes specific  isoforms  of genes associated with breast cancer  phenotype  and we also found functional double hop  fusion transcript  that was transcribed from complex  structure rearrangement  so at last i would like to thank many  collaborators  and members of mana lab  and i have to mention that a  major part of this work was done by shin  number who joined our lab as  a undergraduate student  and now he is at  osaka university as a  graduate student so thank you for  listening  and that's it
 

